  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/03/GimnasticaArtistica.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>Este s&aacute;bado, 17 de marzo, se ha celebrado en el pabell&oacute;n V&iacute;ctor Cabedo Carda la I fase provincial de los juegos deportivos GAF, organizada por el Club Gimnasia Gym-Sport Onda, cuyas componentes han obtenido muy buenos resultados.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ifaseprovincialgimnasia/img_3013.jpg\" alt=\"img_3013\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ifaseprovincialgimnasia/img_3015.jpg\" alt=\"img_3015\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ifaseprovincialgimnasia/img_3016.jpg\" alt=\"img_3016\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ifaseprovincialgimnasia/img_3017.jpg\" alt=\"img_3017\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ifaseprovincialgimnasia/img_3023.jpg\" alt=\"img_3023\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ifaseprovincialgimnasia/img_3025.jpg\" alt=\"img_3025\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ifaseprovincialgimnasia/img_3027.jpg\" alt=\"img_3027\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ifaseprovincialgimnasia/img_3028.jpg\" alt=\"img_3028\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ifaseprovincialgimnasia/img_3030.jpg\" alt=\"img_3030\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439